IBM VGA 8x16 font (src/rgl/font/vga/IBM_VGA_8x16.bin)

Taken from https://github.com/spacerace/romfont, which carries no license; its
fonts were dumped from IBM's MCGA/VGA (PS/2) video BIOS ROMs, and its README
doubts IBM ever released them to the public domain. No license is known for
this file. It is included as-is, its provenance recorded here; see the
repository's notes before redistributing it.
